{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>You have exalted</b> — he says: וְתָרוּם (Psalms 92:10) corresponds to וְאַתָּה מָרוֹם (Psalms 92:9)." "<b>The meaning of כראם</b> — my enemies' [proud thoughts] are very high." "<b>But with fresh oil</b> — שֶׁמֶן הַמֹּר רַעֲנָן קֶרֶן רֹאשִׁי בָלוּל."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 92, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:05.165411396Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}